<mxCell id="t766" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; Guarded: [5, 8, 8, 1], 3 moves. Pouring on the peek while 8 waits puts 1 on top: [5, 1, 1, 8]. Each value still moves once — the order is what breaks." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="370" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
