<mxCell id="t941" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; Strict: [−1, −1, 6, −1] and [−1, −1, −1]. The &lt;= scan writes [6, 6, 6, −1] and [5, 5, −1]. Both are O(n); the wrong operator is a wrong answer at the same cost." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="380" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
